<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 0.406 points off FTSE, Feb 10.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 0.406 points off FTSE, Feb 10.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 stock will go ex-dividend on February 10 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 0.406 point off the index that day.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>    * Great Universal Stores     5.5   6.875    0.406</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
